{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Planted</b> — it refers to the righteous one who is planted in the house of HaShem, and they are the priests and the singers; their blossom is seen in the courts of HaShem, outside the house of HaShem, until all who come for the service of HaShem and for prayer smell them." "<b>They shall blossom</b> — they shall put forth blossom."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 92, :notes {0 "Resolved singular/plural tension: the lemma and initial definition are singular, but the examples shift to plural; preserved both as in the original."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:03.721420386Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}